{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/45666947517d6eed0a22bb3cfd377df6.poster.avif?t=1770121262\" width=788 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/45666947517d6eed0a22bb3cfd377df6.webm?t=1770121262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/45666947517d6eed0a22bb3cfd377df6.mp4?t=1770121262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses the number keypad to play (or equivalent keys if no number keypad is available). Tap the number keys to spawn dollars and earn cash. Tap the enter key to open and close the shop at any point. while in the shop, use the number keys to view upgrades, then the plus key to purchase upgrades. Tap the period key to pause  the game and view settings, stats, and a Beans button. Familiarize yourself with the number keypad and the upgrades to succeed in paying your debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>The recommended controller</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/0d0df77629d8c5ffc8246d8421ed8234.poster.avif?t=1770121262\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921420/extras/0d0df77629d8c5ffc8246d8421ed8234.webm?t=1770121262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\